it and equal the live manifests; the launcher closure moves from `efde5a31…` to `9dadbef0…` exactly as round 5 reviewed. **The merge is not conflict-free**: `git merge --no-ff codex-window` on `main` conflicts in one worklog file (`param_efficiency_worklog.md`, both sides appended after the same entry); the resolution is mechanical (keep both, chronological) and touches no code.
